{"id":"zimoj","lemma":"зимой","pos":"adv","rank":2946,"glosses":["in winter"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/37/Ru-%D0%B7%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%B9.ogg/Ru-%D0%B7%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%B9.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я родился зимой.","en":"I was born in the winter.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be born","l":"родиться"},null]},{"text":"Той зимой было очень холодно.","en":"It was very cold that winter.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"coldly"}]},{"text":"Я боюсь делать это зимой.","en":"I'm afraid to do that in the winter.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to fear, to be afraid","l":"бояться"},{"g":"to make, to do"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Зимой тут хорошо.","en":"It's nice here in the winter.","words":[null,{"g":"here"},{"g":"well, right"}]},{"text":"Я встретил её зимой.","en":"I met her in the winter.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to meet","l":"встретить"},{"g":"her"},null]}]}